# Elite Core

- Protect must-not-break flows first: Auth/Redirect, Employee Expenses, Employee Timesheet.
- Keep UX calm and low-pressure; avoid aggressive CTA patterns.
- Keep primary workflows at 3 clicks or fewer.
- Prefer plain language labels over accounting jargon.
- Keep changes minimal, safe, and backwards compatible with current routes/services.
- After each substantial change: verify the affected flow before moving on.
